"version": "1.0.4",
"title": "來臨中的那日",
"media_type": "Text",
"index_reference": "來臨中的那日",
"language": "zht",
"review_level": "None",
"content": "<p>耶穌在對觀福音中，預言了三件將來的事件：</p><ol><li><p>第一件事件是祂自己的死亡和復活（<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"41008031\" data-end-ref=\"41008031\">可8:31</data>，<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"41009031\" data-end-ref=\"41009031\">9:31</data>，<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"41010033\" data-end-ref=\"41010034\">10:33–34</data>）。這在福音書寫成之前已經發生。</p></li><li><p>耶穌預言的第二件事件，是耶路撒冷毀於公元70年（<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"40024001\" data-end-ref=\"40024028\">太24:1–28</data>，<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"41013001\" data-end-ref=\"41013023\">13:1–23</data>；<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"42019041\" data-end-ref=\"42019044\">路19:41–44</data>，<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"42021005\" data-end-ref=\"42021024\">21:5–24</data>）。馬可在寫福音書時，這個事件可能即將要發生（見<data class=\"resource-ref\" data-content-id=\"26417\" data-resource-code=\"AquiferOpenStudyNotesBookIntros\">馬可福音簡介</data>，「日期」）。然而，這件事件並不是絕對的終結。基督徒群體必須繼續以信心生活，在靈性上警醒、等待神的兒子在榮耀中返回，後者可能很快就會發生（<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"41013034\" data-end-ref=\"41013037\">可13:34–37</data>）。</p></li><li><p>耶穌預言的第三件事件是祂將會再來（<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"40023039\" data-end-ref=\"40023039\">太23:39</data>，<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"40024003\" data-end-ref=\"40024003\">24:3</data>、<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"40024029\" data-end-ref=\"40024031\">29–31</data>，<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"40024036\" data-end-ref=\"40025046\">24:36–25:46</data>；<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"41008038\" data-end-ref=\"41008038\">可8:38</data>，<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"41013024\" data-end-ref=\"41013027\">13:24–27</data>、<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"41013032\" data-end-ref=\"41013037\">32–37</data>；<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"42021025\" data-end-ref=\"42021036\">路21:25–36</data>；<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"43014001\" data-end-ref=\"43014003\">約14:1–3</data>）。新約聖經經常提到耶穌第二次來臨（例如，<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"46001007\" data-end-ref=\"46001008\">林前1:7–8</data>，<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"46003013\" data-end-ref=\"46003013\">3:13</data>，<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"46005005\" data-end-ref=\"46005005\">5:5</data>；<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"47001014\" data-end-ref=\"47001014\">林後1:14</data>；<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"50001006\" data-end-ref=\"50001006\">腓1:6</data>、<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"50001010\" data-end-ref=\"50001010\">10</data>、<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"50002016\" data-end-ref=\"50002016\">2:16</data>；<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"52005001\" data-end-ref=\"52005011\">帖前5:1–11</data>；<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"53002002\" data-end-ref=\"53002002\">帖後2:2</data>；<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"55001012\" data-end-ref=\"55001012\">提後1:12</data>、<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"55001018\" data-end-ref=\"55001018\">18，</data><data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"55004001\" data-end-ref=\"55004001\">4:1</data>、<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"55004008\" data-end-ref=\"55004008\">8</data>）。</p></li></ol><p>當耶穌再來時，神國度的應許將會實現。耶穌將審判並且摧毀撒但和撒但的天使（<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"45016020\" data-end-ref=\"45016020\">羅16:20</data>；<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"53002003\" data-end-ref=\"53002012\">帖後2:3–12</data>）。那些拒絕信靠耶穌的人，將遭受永遠的審判（<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"40013040\" data-end-ref=\"40013042\">太13:40–42，</data><data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"40025031\" data-end-ref=\"40025046\">25:31–46</data>；<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"42006024\" data-end-ref=\"42006026\">路6:24–26，</data><data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"42016019\" data-end-ref=\"42016031\">16:19–31</data>；<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"44010042\" data-end-ref=\"44010042\">徒10:42</data>；<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"49005006\" data-end-ref=\"49005006\">弗5:6</data>；<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"51003006\" data-end-ref=\"51003006\">西3:6</data>；<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"58010025\" data-end-ref=\"58010025\">來10:25</data>；<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"61003007\" data-end-ref=\"61003007\">彼後3:7</data>；<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"65001006\" data-end-ref=\"65001006\">猶1:6</data>；<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"66001007\" data-end-ref=\"66001007\">啟1:7</data>；<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"66006014\" data-end-ref=\"66006014\">6:14</data>、<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"66006017\" data-end-ref=\"66006017\">17</data>）。同時，忠信之人將復活，得享永生（<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"52004013\" data-end-ref=\"52004018\">帖前4:13–18</data>）。神要將祂揀選的子民聚集起來，拯救他們（<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"41013027\" data-end-ref=\"41013027\">可13:27</data>；<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"58001014\" data-end-ref=\"58001014\">來1:14，</data><data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"58009027\" data-end-ref=\"58009028\">9:27–28</data>），賜他們恩典（<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"60001013\" data-end-ref=\"60001013\">彼前1:13</data>）和榮耀（<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"52002012\" data-end-ref=\"52002012\">帖前2:12</data>；<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"53002014\" data-end-ref=\"53002014\">帖後2:14</data>；<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"60001007\" data-end-ref=\"60001007\">彼前1:7</data>；<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"60005001\" data-end-ref=\"60005001\">5:1、</data><data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"60005004\" data-end-ref=\"60005004\">4</data>）。</p><p>祂將賜給祂子民永恆的基業和不會朽壞的新身體（<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"60001004\" data-end-ref=\"60001004\">彼前1:4</data>；<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"46015035\" data-end-ref=\"46015057\">林前15:35–57</data>；<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"50003021\" data-end-ref=\"50003021\">腓3:21</data>；<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"52004013\" data-end-ref=\"52004018\">帖前4:13–18</data>）。神將使受造之物免於一切的詛咒並更新萬物（<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"01003017\" data-end-ref=\"01003018\">創3:17–18</data>；<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"45008020\" data-end-ref=\"45008023\">羅8:20–23</data>；<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"61003012\" data-end-ref=\"61003013\">彼後3:12–13</data>；<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"66021001\" data-end-ref=\"66022005\">啟21:1–22:5</data>）。悲痛、眼淚、哀傷和死亡將不再存在（<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"66021004\" data-end-ref=\"66021004\">啟21:4</data>）。那些在此生忠於基督的人「將得見神」（<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"40005008\" data-end-ref=\"40005008\">太5:8</data>；<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"66022003\" data-end-ref=\"66022003\">啟22:3</data>）。</p><p>因為這些應許，基督徒必須禱告並等待祂的再來（<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"40006010\" data-end-ref=\"40006010\">太6:10</data>；<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"66022020\" data-end-ref=\"66022020\">啟22:20</data>）。我們不應試圖猜測祂再來的日期（<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"41013032\" data-end-ref=\"41013032\">可13:32</data>；<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"44001007\" data-end-ref=\"44001007\">徒1:7</data>）。相反，我們應當坦然無懼生活，並隨時作好準備（<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"62002028\" data-end-ref=\"62002028\">約一2:28</data>；<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"40024036\" data-end-ref=\"40025030\">太24:36–25:30</data>；<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"52005001\" data-end-ref=\"52005011\">帖前5:1–11</data>）。</p><p><span><u>進深研究的經文段落</u></span></p><p><data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"40005008\" data-end-ref=\"40005008\">太5:8</data>，<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"40006010\" data-end-ref=\"40006010\">6:10</data>，<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"40013041\" data-end-ref=\"40013042\">13:41–42</data>，<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"40023039\" data-end-ref=\"40023039\">23:39</data>，<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"40024003\" data-end-ref=\"40025046\">24:3–25:46；</data><data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"41008038\" data-end-ref=\"41008038\">可8:38</data>，<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"41013001\" data-end-ref=\"41013037\">13:1–37</data>，<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"41014025\" data-end-ref=\"41014025\">14:25；</data><data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"42006024\" data-end-ref=\"42006026\">路6:24–26</data>，<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"42016019\" data-end-ref=\"42016031\">16:19–31</data>，<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"42019041\" data-end-ref=\"42019044\">19:41–44</data>，<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"42021005\" data-end-ref=\"42021036\">21:5–36；</data><data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"43014001\" data-end-ref=\"43014003\">約14:1–3；</data><data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"44001006\" data-end-ref=\"44001007\">徒1:6–7</data>，<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"44010042\" data-end-ref=\"44010042\">10:42；</data><data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"45008022\" data-end-ref=\"45008023\">羅8:20–23</data>，<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"45016020\" data-end-ref=\"45016020\">16:20；</data><data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"46001007\" data-end-ref=\"46001008\">林前1:7–8</data>，<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"46015035\" data-end-ref=\"46015058\">15:35–58；</data><data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"47001014\" data-end-ref=\"47001014\">林後1:14；</data><data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"50001006\" data-end-ref=\"50001006\">腓1:6</data>、<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"50001010\" data-end-ref=\"50001010\">10</data>，<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"50002016\" data-end-ref=\"50002016\">2:16</data>，<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"50003021\" data-end-ref=\"50003021\">3:21；</data><data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"52004013\" data-end-ref=\"52004018\">帖前4:13–18；</data><data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"53002002\" data-end-ref=\"53002014\">帖後2:2–14；</data><data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"55004001\" data-end-ref=\"55004008\">提後4:1–8；</data><data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"56002011\" data-end-ref=\"56002013\">多2:11–13；</data><data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"58009028\" data-end-ref=\"58009028\">來9:28</data>，<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"58010025\" data-end-ref=\"58010025\">10:25</data>、<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"58010037\" data-end-ref=\"58010037\">37；</data><data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"60001007\" data-end-ref=\"60001007\">彼前1:7</data>、<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"60001013\" data-end-ref=\"60001013\">13</data>，<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"60005001\" data-end-ref=\"60005004\">5:1–4；</data><data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"61003007\" data-end-ref=\"61003013\">彼後3:7–13；</data><data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"62002028\" data-end-ref=\"62002028\">約一2:28；</data><data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"66001007\" data-end-ref=\"66001007\">啟1:7</data>，<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"66006015\" data-end-ref=\"66006017\">6:15–17</data>，<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"66021001\" data-end-ref=\"66022007\">21:1–22:7</data>，<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"66022012\" data-end-ref=\"66022012\">22:12</data>、<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"66022020\" data-end-ref=\"66022020\">20</data></p>",
